<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- BLANK based on TPB 99</book>
  <para style="ide"/>
  <para style="rem">Consultant Checked July 2024</para>
  <para style="h">Pilemoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pm</para>
  <para style="toc1">Polue Pilemoni Xosa Xayawotai Nakau</para>
  <para style="mt2">Polue Pilemoni</para>
  <para style="mt">Xosa Xayawotai Nakau</para>
  <para style="imt">Akereki kuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Pilemoni nu kire kokaipa apu. Nu Kolosi erewesepue Yesusure xousuwotai. Nupo kire aipu saina apu, nupo wenumu Onesimusi, nue nupo tumu wetina kire erewese ximi xowotai. Pa erewese xosa Onesimusue Polu tutumauna Yesusure xousuwotai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pa yause xosa Polue kakauya xosa puripopouna xou Pilemoni xekopina paiya itou xuwe xetai. Pa xati mua nakau xayaurouna Onesimusi tuworina xesawati, Onesimusue nupo tumu xosa xiyeri xowotai. Pa nakau xosa Polue Pilemoni ipaki kauna ne kakixanau neu saina apu auwou. Mua saina apu nu Yesusure xousuwotai xati, Pilemoni nei nu nakipo xatanini kutu sie xiyeri sowo wotai.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Pilemonipo aipu saina apue ximi xoworina xurise Yesusupo apu sayati Polue Pilemoni xosa xiyeri xesawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:1">Ep 3.1</ref></char></note> Polu, ye Yesusu Kristusupo kakauya apu. Ye xeika sikou xatasiki Timoti xeikae, mua nakau ne Pilemoni xosa xayaunua, ne sinipo asinaku marou xeika saina emesiki xeika. <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>Sinipo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kl 4.17</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 2:3">2 Ti 2.3</ref></char></note> ukusiki Apia xosa rania mua nakau xayaunua, Arkipusi xosa rania xayaunua, sikoe mua Xoiteupo xoma xosa purikiriai xosa nue xomatua purina. Pa xeika Yesusure xonikisuneri taiwoteneai xuiapue neu atoro kununurouneri xosa xayaunua.<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Sikou Xoiteu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:3">Ka 1.3</ref></char></note> Emisiki xeika Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xeikae xonikisuaxete xonikietiketewori tinipo xotikikemu yoroni puropina.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilemonipo asinaku kapiae kakati Polue nimaririxina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Xokupa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:8-9">Ro 1.8-9</ref></char></note> yause ye yeu Xoiteu xosa kunikuninepa, ye neure nanunanune Xoiteu xosa eiyaseuroune, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>pa amure, ninie ye sipesi ipaki kairouneri, nei Kokaipa Yesusu xonikemu tune nure xiri xonisune, Xoiteupo xokupa xuiapu xonienikiroune xirouneri. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Ne<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:9">Pl 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:9">Kl 1.9</ref></char></note> sini xeika etokau sini Kristusure xosikisukiriai xati, sikou xosikisu xosa Xoiteue kakati sikou asinaku sipa yararatia Kristusu xosa xokupa asinaku sapi tirounuku ati sipawopure ye kunikunine. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Iyo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:4">2 Ko 7.4</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 7:13">7.13</ref></char></note>, yewapu, nei Xoiteupo xokupa xuiapu xonienikiroune xati, pa kapiarei ninipo xonikikemu nei sokisokinikitiai. Nei kakau paire ye xiri nimaririti yeu xoikemu yoroarani purina.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilemonie Onesimusi nukou xatau sieni kutu tepina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Ne kire sapi kakewaire ye kunaunena, Kristusu wenumurei kaniti ne pa sapi kakewairau. Pana neu kapia asinaku asinaku ye sipa xati, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:1">Pm 1</ref></char></note> ne sokisoki kuna kanepixe xi nanune. Kireu xiri xonikiewopi kapiae sini axirini paraisirouna, pa xati ye ne yopini kanepurexine. Ye Polu, ye Kristusu Yesusupo kuna tikoutiai apu xati mua Kristusupo saina xosa sakau xine ye rania kakauya xosa purine, <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>yeu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:15">1 Ko 4.15</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:9">Kl 4.9</ref></char></note> nono Onesimusi xosa, asinaku kapia kakewaire ye ne kotonepurexine. Ye kakauya xosa puritiai yause xosa, Onesimusue kouyeyati Kristusure xiri xousuwopinaure tianutiai. Pa xati ye kunaune, nue yeu nononi kutu sayetai. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Ekime nue atina ne saina tianirouwati xana xuwe. Pana muaia nu sio axirini saina tianisiepina sie itou.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Ximine yeu xoikemueni nu xesauti, ne xosa xiyeri utuna. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Yei<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:30">Pl 2.30</ref></char></note> nu taiyeruti ye xeika puropina rania ye xiri nimaririwopine, ye kakitia nue neu sainani tina paiya, ye asinaku kuna uteiwopi sainapu kakauya apu puritiai yause xosa tianiyepina. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:7">2 Ko 9.7</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 5:2">1 Pi 5.2</ref></char></note> paire ne iyo kuna kunawauweyexine, pa xati ye nu taiyeruixe. Nei amu sapirau kakewaire ye kanepi xiraxine. Xuwe. Ye nanutiaia, nei ye tianiyepure asinaku kapia kakepurexinaua, xeuxana nakipo xonieni kakewai.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Suau, Onesimusue xayaka xayaka weinitetai. Pana mua kapia yaraxetai paiya, nei nu xiyeri sowau, ne xeika sipesi puropinarau. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Muaia<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:2">1 Ti 6.2</ref></char></note> nei nanunau nu aipu saina apu xeu. Xuwe. Suau, nu neu aipu saina apu purotaina pana, muaia neu xatanini kutu sayati nei xiri xoniewowai. Nue yeu xataini kutu puriewati xekeuroune xati nu xosa yeu xoikemu tune. Pana ye sipa, nei nu xiri xoniewowai. Nue aipu saina apue kakiewati kapia xoniewowai, Kristusu xosa paiya xatanini kutu xekeuyeunaua, nu xiri xoniewowai.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:23">2 Ko 8.23</ref></char></note> ne ye xekeyau Kristusupo saina xosa ye neu emenini kutu sie xitia, paina iko titiai kapia sieni Onesimusi xiyeri tewai. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Nu kireu kapia xoreiyeretaire e ne xosa xapa tuku xatia, paina nupo wenumu pirixinau pa xapa xosa yeu wenimi iyarewai. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:11">Ka 6.11</ref></char></note> Polu, ye ikou xupieni mua kuna xayautiai. Ye ikoini pa sapi xapa iyarepine. Ye ipakine rania kunaune ne ye xosa xapa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:21">1 Ko 16.21</ref></char></note> tuku, paiya nakipo ekiniomapu xapa. Pana ye paire kunawopi xiraxine. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Xatai, iyese. Kokaipapu wenumurei nei pa asinaku kapia ye xosai kakewai. Sini Kristusupo apu purinua, pa xati pa kapiarei ne yeu xoikemu asinakuworewai.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Nei yeu mua kuna taiwowai xati ye panumu ati sipautiai, pa xati mua nakau ne xosa xayaune. Ye sipa, nei Onesimusi xosa kakewai kapia paiya, nei kakewai xine mua yei kotonitiai kapia xiri emeseriwopina. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:25">Pl 1.25</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:24">2.24</ref></char></note> pani kire kuna tuku. Ye ipakine xoisutiaia Xoiteue tinipo kunikuni iyeserina paiya ye weitati tini xosa xiyeri utopine. Pa xati neu atoro xinepineure ye kire ata kama ireiyeriyewai.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polupo saina emeumanae Pilemoni kusouneri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Epaprasie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Kl 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4.12</ref></char></note> ne kusonina. Nu kakauya xosa purati, sioxororoni Kristusu Yesusupo kakauya xosa purinua. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Yeu emeimana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">YT 12.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:25">12.25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13.13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15.37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19.29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27.2</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:10">Kl 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">4.14</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2 Ti 4.10-11</ref></char></note>, paiya Maki xuno Aristakusi xuno Temasi xuno, Luku xuno, ninie rania ne kuso tinineri.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusue xousuawati xouwetiketai kapia tini xeika purina.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
